Sense 1 (“type of colloid”) is derived from {{m|en|-sol}} (in words like {{m|en|alcosol}} and {{m|en|hydrosol}}), an {{abbrev|en|solution|nocap=1}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|pos=''n.''{{sup|6}}|noformat=1|id=184027|date=September 2018|nodot=1}}; {{R:Lexico|alt=sol{{sup|2}}|pos=n}}</ref>

Sense 2 (“solution to an objection”) is derived directly from {{m|en|solution}}.<ref>{{R:OED Online|entry=† sol|pos=''n.''{{sup|4}}|noformat=1|id=184025|date=March 2021}}</ref>

